#: prefs.ui.h:32
msgid ""
"API keys can be obtained from the <a href=\"https://api.nasa.gov/index."
"html#apply-for-an-api-key\">NASA APOD website</a>.\n"
"Each key is limited to 1000 requests per hour, and hence you may not be able "
"to refresh with the default keys."
msgstr ""
"API-sleutels kunnen worden opgehaald op de <a href=\"https://api.nasa.gov/"
"index.html#apply-for-an-api-key\">NASA APOD-website</a>.\n"
"Elke sleutel is beperkt tot 1000 opvragingen per uur, wat betekent dat de "
"standaardsleutel mogelijk niet afdoende is."

